# Independent integer/FP ops: IPC should scale with issue width
Integer adder    8         1                              4
FP adder         8         2                              4
FP multiplier    4         4                              2
Load/store unit  8         1              2               2
ROB entries = 64
Issue width = 1
R1=1, R2=2, R3=3, R4=4, F1=1.5, F2=2.5, F3=3.5, F4=4.5
Addi R5, R1, 10
Addi R6, R2, 20
Add R7, R3, R4
Sub R8, R4, R3
Add.d F5, F1, F2
Sub.d F6, F3, F4
Add.d F7, F1, F3
Mult.d F8, F2, F4
Addi R9, R1, 1
Addi R10, R2, 2
Add.d F9, F2, F4
Mult.d F10, F1, F3
